AcquisitionMethod: data-dependent acquisition mode
AlkylationReagent: IAA
CellLine: HeLa S3 cells (DSMZ, Braunschweig, Germany)
CellPart: lysate
CleavageAgent: trypsin
CollisionEnergy: normalized collision energy of 27
FlowRateChromatogram: 10 µL/min
FlowRateChromatogram: 250 µL/min
FragmentMassTolerance: 0.02 Da
GradientTime: 40 min
Instrument: Q Exactive mass spectrometer (Thermo Scientific)
MaterialType: cell line
Modification: carbamidomethylation of Cys
Modification: oxidation of Met
Modification: phosphorylation of Ser/Thr/Tyr
NumberOfMissedCleavages: 2
NumberOfSamples: single run
Organism: Homo sapiens
PrecursorMassTolerance: 10 ppm
ReductionReagent: DTT
Separation: nano RSLC HPLC system
Separation: trap column (C18, 100 μm x 2 cm PepMap RSLC, Thermo Scientific)
Separation: 50 cm main column (C18, 75 μm x 50 cm PepMap RSLC, Thermo Scientific)
